[36m(TaskRunner pid=160284)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=160284)[0m The number \( 17_b \) in base 10 is:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=160284)[0m \[ 1 \cdot b + 7 = b + 7. \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=160284)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=160284)[0m The number \( 97_b \) in base 10 is:
